   <media:description>What would Illini students say to the people they love back home? 🧡

We took an orange phone to the Quad at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign and asked Illini students to leave a message for someone special. From sharing updates to saying “I miss you,” these heartfelt messages capture the connections and moments that make the college experience meaningful. Life at #ILLINOIS is full of new experiences, but no matter how far you go, home is always part of your story.</media:description>
